# Publish shop changes

After changing this shop, commit the work and push it to `origin` (`https://github.com/wbkwbk/Webshop.git`) on `main`.

Do not commit or push:

- `.env`, `.env.local`, or any mailbox or SMTP password
- `data/shop.db` and other local database files

Leave those only on this computer. Do not force-push.
